    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Is an AI "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "chatbot",
            "zh": "AI聊天机器人"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " your bestie for homework? Asking a chatbot is fast and easy, but here’s a surprise: Using a traditional "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "search engine",
            "ref": "v-search-engine"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " might help you "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " more than asking AI."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Researchers tested over 10,000 people. They were asked to research "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " topics, like how to grow a garden or how to lead a healthier life. Some used AI chatbots while others used "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " web searches. After that, they wrote down what they had learned as "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "advice",
            "ref": "v-advice"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for a friend. What happened? People who searched the web developed "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " knowledge."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Why? Using AI is like riding a bus. You get to the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "destination",
            "zh": "目的地"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " fast, but you don’t really know the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". You just sit and wait for the ride to end. But searching the web is like hiking on your own. You have to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the map, choose the right path, and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "notice",
            "ref": "v-notice"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the landmarks like signs or special buildings. This brain "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "workout",
            "zh": "锻炼"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " helps you really understand and "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the information."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The study also found something interesting. Even when the AI chatbots gave links to websites, 75% of people did not "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "click",
            "ref": "v-click"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " them. They didn’t want to learn more once they had the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " answer."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "So, next time you are "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "curious",
            "ref": "v-curious"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", do not just ask a chatbot for the answer. Be a real "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "! Go information hunting on the web, and your brain will thank you for the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "extra",
            "ref": "v-extra"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " work."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
